### Application configuration — NEVER commit, no exceptions ###
# Every application*.properties file stays out of git, including profile files
# added later (staging, uat, …) and any .example copy. Configuration is supplied
# per environment: locally by the file you create yourself, in production by
# environment variables.
#
# What the backend needs is documented in docs/backend-configuration.md, which
# holds names and explanations only — never a value.
src/main/resources/application*.properties*
